# Staged files only: no .env files, no secrets, lint (with fixes), format.
# Relative paths and a lower argument limit keep each command under the
# Windows command-line limit (8191 characters) when many files are staged:
# lint-staged splits the file list at the limit, and the package manager's
# command shims add their own path on top. See lint-staged.config.js and docs/git-hooks.md.
pnpm exec lint-staged --relative --max-arg-length 6000
